WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,290
I can't even carry the luggage of a three-and-a-half-year-old kid

2
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:08,510
It looks like he's smiling, but in fact he has nothing left to do.

3
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:17,980
Fourth Young Master, let me help you get up and get out of your way, you trash.

4
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,980
If you want to see my joke, watch it and laugh.

5
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:23,980
Good baby, great baby, grow taller quickly

6
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,980
You give me a red envelope

7
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:33,620
By the way, now you kiss me

8
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:37,040
Who taught you that at a young age you would use whatever means necessary?

9
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,040
please people

10
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:41,040
Fourth Young Master, please touch your upper and lower lips.

11
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:44,540
I'm afraid you'll poison yourself

12
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:48,570
Brother, my hand is not broken

13
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:49,570
Where does this little literary style come from?

14
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:53,110
Miss Youyou, it’s me who will take care of the bag.

15
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:56,500
Miss Youyou, I don’t want it anymore.

16
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,230
Oh I understand

17
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:02,230
Say thank you and put it in your hand. Say don’t put it in your pocket.

18
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:06,150
It doesn't bother me at all

19
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:13,640
Miss Youyou doesn’t seem to be as vicious as the rumors say.

20
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:19,650
You just carried it so neatly

21
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:21,840
Youyou has a lot of strength

22
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,840
The little kid is pretty awesome
